	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8417">Musculi</persName> nostri obitum iam prius te ex meis ad <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>fratrem nuper missis cognovisse et te nobiscum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>dolere et magno moerore affici non dubito.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Dominus soletur nos omnes et ecclesiae suae su<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ccurrat teque unicum iam ex veteranis illis superstitem <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nobis quam diutissime incolumem conservet!</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Nos hic agimus iam ut pupilli optimo patre orbati <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>nec, quo nos vertamus, satis scimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Opus haberemus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>alio tali viro; sed ubi reperiemus?</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Atque etiamsi reperiretur, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quomodo eos impetrabimus?</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ego cogitationes <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>meas omnes in <persName ref="p8386">Hyperium</persName> intendo; de illo solo spero <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>fieri posse, ut se inde, ubi est, avellat et ut a nostris <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>recipiatur quoque.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">De <persName ref="p4037">Zancho</persName> post illam subscriptionem <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>nihil est, quod hic agamus aut speremus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Tuum tamen, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>quod mihi mature significare velis, peto consilium <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>simulque rogo, ut tua authoritate et tuis literis apud <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>d. <persName ref="p8063">Steigerum</persName>, <persName ref="p3659">Mülinensem</persName> et <persName ref="p7511">Grafenriedum</persName>, quorum pra<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ecipua in hisce est authoritas, iuvare velis, ut ad <persName ref="p8386">Hyperium</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>accersendum animum advertant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Illum enim si habere <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>possemus, videretur vulnus ecclesiae nostrae me<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>diocriter sanatum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ex nostris neminem habemus, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>qui succedere possit praeter <persName ref="p8092">Benedictum Aretium</persName>, <persName ref="p8416">Abrahamum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Musculum</persName> aut <persName ref="p8052">Valentinum Ampelandrum</persName>; sed <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>illorum authoritas tanta non est, quantam hic locus requirit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Ego de hoc valde sum sollicitus; vereor enim, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ne Proteus ille <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensis</placeName>, qui se ubique ingerit et <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>insinuat, suffusurus sit aliquid, quod nos interturbet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Ideo in tempore vellem illi obviam iri.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Interea <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>tamen dominum, qui pro sua providentia et nutu omnia <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>disponit, oro, ut ipse nobis succurrat et alium substituat, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>cuius opera et puritas doctrinae et concordia <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>inter nos conservari possit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Tu idem orabis nobiscum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Quod uxorem <persName ref="p8417">Musculi</persName> attinet, quamvis adhuc decumbat, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>convalescere tamen pulchre videtur, sic etiam filius eius <persName ref="p19065">Io<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>annes Friderychus</persName>; dominus illos soletur et clementer restituat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Novi alias nihil habeo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Ago vero tibi gratias pro illis, quę <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>mihi communicasti, et rogo, ut, quę ex <placeName ref="l157">Francofurto</placeName> acceperis, <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>itidem nobis communices.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Ubi <persName>Sabaudicum</persName> negotium pendeat, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>cognosces ex iis, quas ad fratrem scribo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Obiisse ferebatur <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>princeps; sed nihil erit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Dominus inspiciat hic quoque et componat <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>omnia!</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l167">Genevenses</placeName> nullam prorsus pacem admissuros audio, <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>nisi omnem, qualem nunc habent, libertatem retineant; princeps <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>vero suum ius sibi restitui petit; itaque nescio, quo <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>res adhuc casura sit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de">Vil guͦter lüth hie meinend, man <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>hab sich ztieff inglaßen; man bhielte es wol alles; aber <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>man wil einmal friden han.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de">Gott gebe, das er wol grate.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z47"/>Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te dominus <persName ref="p8063">consul Steigerus</persName>, <persName ref="p3659">Mülinensis</persName>, <persName ref="p8012">Hallerus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z48"/><persName ref="p8389">Hagius</persName>, <persName>Emanuel</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p7511">Grafenriedus</persName> <placeName ref="l21">Badenę</placeName> est, ut scis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z49"/>Saluta tu meo nomine amicos et fratres omnes, praesertim eos, <lb xml:id="p1z50"/>qui sunt de domo tua, una cum universa familia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z51"/><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 9. septembris 1563.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z52"/><persName ref="p8018">Iohannes Hallerus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z53"/>tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae pastori fidelissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>domino suo honorando et <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>compatri charissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
